vo_avfoundation: AVFoundation video output

The whole of vo_avfoundation.m, which no upstream mpv carries. Every change
to the file lives here instead of in a follow-up patch: a follow-up applies
by context, so a version bump that breaks one would cascade through every
later one, while a single file creation cannot conflict at all.

